  "description": "Strategy page entry/exit: every Main and Strategy slide pose, input ignored during motion, reserve selection and reopening reset. Preset panel slides, rename fades, ignored preset input and responsive rename input during opening, cancellation and confirmation. Independent Main and Strategy selections, including returning to the Main reserve page. Back-to-back rename/preset cancellation during overlapping fades.",
  "registration": "Uses the existing Rust-cooked eight-member Strategy fixture with skit 833 already viewed. Native update 64 is source VI 0, with source-observed ambient and UI origins applied once. All subsequent inputs and captures use source VI + 64, without waits, seeks or clock adjustments. State gates compare party, field effects and Strategy selection, instructions, presets, slide opacity and UI clock. Main gates cover the other half of each handoff. Reopening must reset the selected member and scroll position. Preset and rename opacities are also checked at every pose; rename accepts input while fading whereas the preset slide blocks it. The final handoff enters Strategy from Main's reserve page, selects a different Strategy member and verifies that Main retains its own viewport. Rapid cancellation checks the rename overlay disappears with its preset parent even while its opacity counter is still fading.",
